,{"id":"b3-018-005","sourceId":"b3-018-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Strange forms stand in gardens, and outside buildings and shops.","start":39.96,"end":44.41,"score":0.988,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-006","sourceId":"b3-018-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"We have got quite used to them.","start":45.8,"end":47.3,"score":0.93,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-007","sourceId":"b3-018-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Some so-called 'modern' pieces have been on display for nearly eighty years.","start":48.46,"end":53.04,"score":0.961,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-008","sourceId":"b3-018-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"In spite of this, some people--including myself--were surprised by a recent exhibition of modern sculpture.","start":54.67,"end":62.16,"score":0.942,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-009-p01","sourceId":"b3-018-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The first thing I saw when I entered the art gallery was a notice which said:","start":63.7,"end":68.08,"score":0.968,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-009-p02","sourceId":"b3-018-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[16,26],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"'Do not touch the exhibits, some of them are dangerous!'","start":68.67,"end":73.0,"score":0.965,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-010","sourceId":"b3-018-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The objects on display were pieces of moving sculpture.","start":73.72,"end":76.99,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-011","sourceId":"b3-018-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Oddly shaped forms that are suspended from the ceiling and move in response to a gust of wind are quite familiar to everybody.","start":77.61,"end":85.3,"score":0.947,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-012","sourceId":"b3-018-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,5],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"These objects, however, were different.","start":86.39,"end":88.92,"score":0.987,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-013","sourceId":"b3-018-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Lined up against the wall, there were long thin wires attached to metal spheres.","start":89.97,"end":95.04,"score":0.96,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-014","sourceId":"b3-018-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The spheres had been magnetized and attracted or repelled each other all the time.","start":96.08,"end":101.7,"score":0.939,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-015","sourceId":"b3-018-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"In the centre of the hall, there were a number of tall structures which contained coloured lights.","start":102.81,"end":108.34,"score":0.895,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-016","sourceId":"b3-018-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"These lights flickered continuously like traffic lights which have gone mad.","start":109.38,"end":114.09,"score":0.957,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-017","sourceId":"b3-018-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Sparks were emitted from small black boxes and red lamps flashed on and off angrily.","start":114.62,"end":120.59,"score":0.948,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-018","sourceId":"b3-018-018","sourceIndex":17,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It was rather like an exhibition of prehistoric electronic equipment.","start":121.58,"end":126.02,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-018-019","sourceId":"b3-018-019","sourceIndex":18,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"These peculiar forms not only seemed designed to shock people emotionally, but to give them electric shocks as well!","start":127.12,"end":135.05,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
